  "report": "# Matching engine + backtester: results\n\nGenerated by `python -m exchange.run` (Python 3.14.0, win32). All numbers below come from that run.\n\n## Engine benchmark\n\nDeterministic synthetic flow of 300,000 commands (seed 42).\n\n| metric | value |\n|---|---|\n| throughput (best of 3) | 214,338 orders/s |\n| latency p50 | 7.2 µs |\n| latency p99 | 17.3 µs |\n| latency p99.9 | 52.6 µs |\n| latency max | 1758.3 µs |\n| events per command | 2.72 |\n| mean book depth (levels bid / ask) | 15.3 / 15.2 |\n| mean / max resting orders | 141.2 / 326 |\n| journal replay reproduces book hash | True |\n\nCommand mix: Cancel 113,810, FOK 1,375, IOC 5,881, LIMIT 153,354, MARKET 4,613, POST_ONLY 11,993, Replace 8,974.\n\nEvents emitted: Ack 176,558, BookDelta 309,998, Booked 150,744, Cancelled 115,881, Fill 54,555, Reject 697, Replaced 8,935.\n\n## Backtest (seed 7, 30,000 steps = 60 sim days)\n\nFees: taker $0.0030/sh, maker rebate $0.0020/sh. Strategy orders arrive 1 step after the decision, behind that step's background flow.\n\n| | market maker | momentum |\n|---|---|---|\n| **net PnL** | $190.80 | $465.00 |\n| PnL with costs ignored (fills at mid, no fees) | -$1,923.00 | $1,732.50 |\n|   spread capture / slippage | $1,597.00 | -$916.50 |\n|   fees & rebates | $516.80 | -$351.00 |\n| Sharpe (net, annualised daily) | 4.39 | 3.01 |\n| Sharpe (costs ignored) | -19.93 | 12.15 |\n| max drawdown (net) | $78.40 | $248.50 |\n| fills / filled shares | 2,584 / 258,400 | 826 / 117,000 |\n| fill ratio (filled / offered shares) | 0.3686 | 0.9974 |\n| maker share of volume | 1.0 | 0.0 |\n| inventory mean abs / max abs / final | 53.8 / 300 / 0 | 182.1 / 500 / 0 |\n| avg shares queued ahead when booked | 1161.7 | n/a (IOC only) |\n\nRegime mix (steps): calm 8,268, trend_down 5,633, trend_up 7,850, volatile 8,249.\n\n## Seed robustness (5 seeds: 7, 11, 23, 42, 99)\n\n| strategy | net PnL > 0 | costs-ignored PnL > 0 | mean Sharpe net | mean Sharpe costs ignored |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| market_maker | 5/5 | 0/5 | 7.36 | -20.71 |\n| momentum | 3/5 | 5/5 | 1.23 | 9.62 |\n\n| strategy | seed | net PnL | costs-ignored PnL | Sharpe net | Sharpe costs ignored |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| market_maker | 7 | $190.80 | -$1,923.00 | 4.39 | -19.93 |\n| market_maker | 11 | $197.30 | -$2,185.00 | 4.24 | -21.93 |\n| market_maker | 23 | $254.00 | -$1,794.00 | 5.76 | -19.91 |\n| market_maker | 42 | $299.20 | -$1,783.50 | 6.37 | -19.89 |\n| market_maker | 99 | $431.60 | -$1,387.50 | 16.03 | -21.9 |\n| momentum | 7 | $465.00 | $1,732.50 | 3.01 | 12.15 |\n| momentum | 11 | $686.60 | $2,048.50 | 2.99 | 9.28 |\n| momentum | 23 | -$231.00 | $949.00 | -1.6 | 7.88 |\n| momentum | 42 | $323.00 | $1,477.50 | 1.85 | 9.59 |\n| momentum | 99 | -$12.00 | $898.00 | -0.12 | 9.19 |\n\nTotal run time: 42.3 s (benchmark 12.7 s).\n"
